  "changes": [
    "Selected 12 source OBJ files from the PART-OF and IS-A trees: 6 PART-OF files and 6 IS-A files.",
    "Merged each structure's source parts into one selectable mesh: 10 selectable nodes.",
    "Included the four renal vessels (left and right renal artery and vein) as shared cardiovascular context; cardiovascular remains the canonical owner.",
    "Converted millimetres and the Z-up axis to metres and Y-up, centred the combined model, and recomputed vertex normals.",
    "Exported one uncompressed GLB with stable mesh names. No source colours or textures are used; surface colours are ours.",
    "Kept 5 structures as text-only entries because BodyParts3D 4.0 has no independent mesh for them."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Combined six PART-OF urinary-organ element files and six IS-A renal-vessel element files into ten selectable nodes.",
    "Marked the four renal vessels as sharedWith: cardiovascular, with cardiovascular as canonicalOwner, so a future whole-body view can avoid drawing them twice.",
    "Applied the same millimetre-to-metre and Z-up-to-Y-up transform as heart.v2.glb, then centred on the combined urinary bounding box.",
    "Recomputed vertex normals after merging. No source colours or textures are used; surface colours are chosen for Lor Mentor.",
    "Kept five renal parts text-only because BodyParts3D 4.0 has no independent mesh for them.",
    "Checked left/right orientation in both the source frame and the output GLB."
  ],
